# ============================================================
# Smart School - Environment Variables
# ============================================================

# --- LOCAL DEVELOPMENT (SQLite) ---
# Uses a relative path so it works on any machine after cloning.
# The database file will be created at <project-root>/db/custom.db
DATABASE_URL="file:./db/custom.db"

# --- PRODUCTION (Vercel + Turso) ---
# For Vercel deployment, use Turso (SQLite-compatible, serverless-friendly).
# 1. Create a free Turso account at https://turso.tech
# 2. Create a database: turso db create smart-school
# 3. Get your connection string: turso db show smart-school --url
# 4. Get your auth token: turso db tokens create smart-school
# 5. Set these in Vercel Environment Variables:
#
#    DATABASE_URL="libsql://smart-school-<your-name>.turso.io"
#    DATABASE_AUTH_TOKEN="<your-token>"
